Signal logic
Each ticker gets a score from -5 to +5 based on:
IndicatorBullishBearishRSI< 35 (oversold)> 70 (overbought)MACDBullish crossoverBearish crossoverBollinger BandsPrice near lower bandPrice near upper bandSMA 20/50Price > SMA20 > SMA50Price < SMA20 < SMA50VolumeHigh vol + up moveHigh vol + down move
Score → Signal:

≥ 3 → BUY
1–2 → WATCH
−1 to 0 → HOLD
≤ −3 → SELL


Adding tickers
Edit WATCHLIST in the file, or type any ticker in the sidebar's "Add ticker" field at runtime.

